<title>NETHERLANDS: Stad Rotterdam Q3 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Stad Rotterdam Q3 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q3 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    41.0  vs  34.4</p>
<p>Full name - Assurantiekantoor Stad Rotterdam Anno 1720 NV.  </p>
<p>Pre-tax profit per sector:</p>
<p>    - Non-life				 30.5   vs  22.9</p>
<p>    - Life				     32.1   vs  29.8</p>
<p>    - Other activities			8.0   vs   6.7</p>
<p>    - Tax					20.3   vs  16.5</p>
<p>    - Third party interests		 9.3   vs   8.5</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
